command-description-ladder-group_add = Add a ladder to a new or existing group. (Note: The ladder's 'Level' value must be unique in the group.)
command-description-ladder-group_rem = Remove a ladder from its group, cutting all connections.
command-description-ladder-set_level = Set the 'Level' value of a ladder. If the ladder is part of a group then its new level must be unique.
